          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do SIHOO products come with a warranty?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, all SIHOO products come with a warranty. Our office chairs typically include a 3-year warranty, covering defects in materials and workmanship. You can find more information on warranty details with each product listing.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_WPAAPK": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I claim a warranty?",
            "answer": "<p>If you experience any issues with your SIHOO product, please contact our support team at <a>support@sihoo.com.au</a> or call 1300 002 580. Provide your proof of purchase and details about the issue, and we’ll guide you through the warranty process.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_KwFjYc": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I return my SIHOO chair if I’m not satisfied?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, we offer a hassle-free return policy. If you’re not satisfied with your purchase, you can return the product within 30 days of receipt for a full refund or exchange. Please note, a restocking fee may apply for certain returns. The item must be in its original packaging and condition. For more details, please refer to our return policy.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
